cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below."
title: "Operations Research Lab: continuous optimization models for Management Engineering"
abstract: >-
  Complete teaching material for the Operations Research Lab: online lecture
  notes, Python/Gurobi code, data and case studies. Seventeen chapters covering
  linear and nonlinear programming theory, solver usage, eight deterministic
  models, decisions under uncertainty, and optimization for machine learning.
  Every model uses continuous variables only and a single solver.
